                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A great story from start to finish it goes into great detail and makes sure that all your questions are answered by the end of the game and ties up some other details that might sit in the back of your mind in the extend portion of the game. Even though this is my first time playing a visual novel that has multiple endings I enjoyed on how the game will lend you a hand on how to fix your mistakes. However, the one thing that bothered me was the SSS wheel to make your decisions; as it doesn't feel intuitive to how you want the story to play out. On my first play through of the game I gotten really close to the end but kept missing certain points that would lead me to a bad ending which seems impossible to pass for some parts of the story while other ones are easily avoidable. Overall I would rate it a 9.5/10",
